  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto recently hosted ten former National Police chiefs at his residence in Hambalang, Bogor, amid an ongoing investigation into illegal wiretapping activities. The investigation, led by the National Police, includes potential charges of treason, a crime that carries severe legal penalties. The government has stated that no individuals are exempt from the law and that the probe demonstrates a firm commitment to legal accountability. Meanwhile, the Witness and Victim Protection Agency is currently processing a request from the police to secure protection for six witnesses connected to the case. High-ranking officials, including the Head of Government Communications, have emphasized that the administration remains focused on uncovering the extent of the alleged unauthorized surveillance. Public discourse remains high as various stakeholders call for a thorough investigation into the security breach involving the President and other public figures.",
